msgid ""
"I agree to the extraction of the tooth listed on this form. The dentist "
"explained the alternatives (keeping the tooth with root canal treatment, or "
"no treatment) and the possible risks: pain, swelling, bleeding, infection, "
"dry socket, damage to neighbouring teeth or fillings, temporary or rarely "
"permanent numbness of the lip or tongue, and sinus involvement for upper "
"back teeth. I will follow the post-operative instructions given to me."
msgstr ""

